From: Selman Trabzon <selman.trbzon@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:52:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat: receiver mode, a player that other apps drive

Built with --dart-define=RECEIVER_MODE=true. Jellyfin remote PlayNow or a
play link opens the player; every other route lands on a small idle page,
and the desktop window hides whenever no player is open.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
